## Self Download YouTube Videos

Download YouTube videos (MP4) or audio (MP3) directly to your computer.
- Self: runs on your own computer.
- No ads or tracking built into the app.
- No random online downloader websites.
- Downloads are saved locally on your computer.

## How to build

in powershell
docker build --no-cache -t youtube-downloader .
Build the Docker image (usually takes 1–2 minutes):
in powershell
docker run --rm -it -v "${PWD}/downloads:/downloads" youtube-downloader



## How to run 
1. Choose MP4 video or MP3 audio, paste your link, and wait for the download to finish.
